WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.560
The Church of the Broken God worships the
holiness of machinery, and the God Mekhane

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:08.029
who rules over all things.

00:00:08.029 --> 00:00:13.830
What would you do if society as we know it
crumbled, humanity fell from grace, and the

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:16.610
Church took over the world at large?

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:20.970
Would you make your way to the Cogwork Orthodoxy
to upgrade your fragile meat body with some

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.590
pristine machinery?

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:28.120
What sort of changes would you make, how are
you going to adapt to the New World Order?

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:33.679
We posed this question to the amazing fans
of SCP Explained, and you told us about all

00:00:33.679 --> 00:00:38.899
of the ways you would upgrade your fragile
human bodies to adjust to the new world.

00:00:38.899 --> 00:00:43.719
So let’s get right to it and see who would
rise to the challenge and please the mighty

00:00:43.719 --> 00:00:47.539
Mekhane, and who would perish as a useless
flesh bag.

00:00:47.539 --> 00:00:52.129
Sean Michelson said, “I would replace my
left arm with nerve damage from when I broke

00:00:52.129 --> 00:00:57.379
it as a kid and the bionic replacement would
be capable of morphing into any shape necessary

00:00:57.379 --> 00:00:58.809
for the task at hand.

00:00:58.809 --> 00:01:04.049
(Lock pick, axe, sword, etc)”
We’re off to a great start here, Sean!

00:01:04.049 --> 00:01:07.710
You turning your left arm into the world’s
coolest Swiss Army Knife sounds like a heck

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:08.710
of an upgrade!

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:13.060
Now that you’ve accepted Mekhane into your
heart, you’ll never have to go to the hardware

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:14.640
store again!

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:18.530
Quick question, though…what are you planning
on using that lock pick for?

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:23.010
If you’re planning a heist, make sure you
do it safely, and see if you can transform

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:25.829
that arm into a sweet getaway car.

00:01:25.829 --> 00:01:30.299
Pyronaught682 said, “I always took pride
in my size.

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:34.810
If I got enhancements at all, I'd get some
that would either make me a proper goliath

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:37.250
or a tall, gaunt, but sturdy frame.

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:41.780
Either way, my presence would be enough to
intimidate.”

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:44.700
How tall are we talking, here?

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:46.030
Slenderman tall?

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:47.869
Empire State Building tall?

00:01:47.869 --> 00:01:51.869
Either way, it’s admirable that in a world
where you can be any cybernetically enhanced

00:01:51.869 --> 00:01:55.380
thing you want, you’re choosing to just
be big and scary.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:59.759
Hey, if it’s good enough for MechaGodzilla,
it’s good enough for us.

00:01:59.759 --> 00:02:04.490
Ivan Piccinin said, “The most fragile and
exposed part of our body are probably the

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:10.080
eyes: a prototype might be a new model of
artificial eyes can provide an omnidirectional

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:14.580
sight, being of metal they don't need to be
hydrated, making the person with them have

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:16.860
a constant view of the surroundings.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.790
It might also allow blind people able to see
again.”

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:22.480
That’s an excellent idea!

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:26.410
You’ll put the eye drop companies out of
business for good, not to mention how the

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:31.480
global glasses economy would crash, but that’s
a small price to pay for giving supervision

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:33.450
to anyone who wants it!

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:37.940
Maybe you’ll even be able to see why kids
love the taste of Cinnamon Toast Crunch.

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:42.750
KaiserAfini said, “I would seek the most
advanced upgrade I can think of: one that

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:48.500
allowed me to create a research center inside
a black hole, allowing the movement of myself

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.670
and anything else I designate to and from
it.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:57.560
Distance and time are unacceptable hindrances
in the project of optimizing the omniverse,

00:02:57.560 --> 00:03:01.190
Euclidean physics only limit advanced inventions
as well.

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:04.230
We must evolve past such limitations.”

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:06.930
Well now you’re thinking outside the box!

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.290
Outside of all Euclidean shapes, really!

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:13.950
Not entirely sure what kind of upgrade would
let you set up shop inside a black hole, but

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:16.760
there’s nothing wrong with shooting for
the stars!

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:21.140
Or a gravitational pull strong enough to absorb
stars and snuff out their light, leaving only

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:22.200
darkness behind!

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:29.110
Jos Moore said, “I would attempt to integrate
SCP 294 into my own body, providing limitless

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:33.900
sustenance and a very effective weapon if
used creatively”

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:37.810
Why upgrade your body so that it no longer
needs food and water, when you can just stick

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:41.140
a coffee machine in your chest and have endless
mochaccinos?

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:43.730
That’s a life of luxury.

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:49.610
Plus, SCP-294 can produce non-potable liquids
such as sulfuric acid and even liquid nitrogen

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:52.140
(for when you really need someone to chill).

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:56.930
It’s got everything you need, and now it’s
part of your body!

00:03:56.930 --> 00:04:01.140
It might be a little clunky carrying around
a vending machine everywhere, but who needs

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:05.480
to fit through doors when you have all the
banana smoothies you could ever want?

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:08.960
Mason Skorup said, “The skin would be interesting.

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:14.430
I'm imagining a sleek human form, a much more
aesthetically awesome kind of shield.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:17.100
Flexible and durable, much more resilient.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:20.470
Body temperature regulation would be the first
issue that comes to mind.

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:23.280
No more glands is a pretty big overhaul.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:26.740
As well as the fact that your skin is where
all of your nerve feelers are located.

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:30.750
Perks: No acne, body odor, splinters or other
damage.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:36.220
Cool lights and stuff if you want, that sleek
metallic shine, potentially way upgraded physical

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:37.220
senses.

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:42.990
Cons, you look like a robot, you'd be pretty
conductive (I guess that could also be a perk)

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:46.440
so surroundings of extreme temperatures could
pose threats.

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:50.660
Your skin absorbs a lot of things, so that
would go away, as well as the microbiome on

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:51.660
it.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:55.160
That would make you much more readily sterile,
but could also vector diseases that jump on

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.490
to your exterior more easily.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:00.440
And another big thing I think of is tarnishing.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:04.930
We dont want an Elden Ring scenario on our
hands 😂 that being said you would absolutely

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:08.160
kill it at any comicon or drag show you went
to 😁”

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:13.260
We should all be so lucky as to live in the
future Mason has imagined.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:17.750
Just think of it: throngs of beautiful robot
people in line to get robo-Patrick Stewart’s

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:22.590
autograph at Comic Con before watching a real
live Transformer performance, and all the

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:24.780
while no one sweats or smells?

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:27.470
That’s paradise on Earth right there.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:32.580
Xavier Rausch said, “I'd personally like
to get my left arm modified for a more industrial

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:38.300
looking one with a similar look to "The Clockwork
Virus" sort of style for my own reasons like;

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:42.930
being able to show off my taste in industrial
stuff, being able to push and carry things

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:47.860
easier with my non dominant hand, or even
just look more proud of myself.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:51.090
That is what I'd do if I could get my arm
all mechanicalized!”

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:53.970
Who said style over substance is a bad thing?

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:58.580
Rock that new clockwork arm and usher in an
industrial fashion craze.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:01.520
All the coolest mechanized kids are doing
it.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:06.750
muhammad ksatria akbar said, “I always wonder
what it feels like to become a toaster”

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:10.330
Boy, do we have an SCP for you!

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:16.060
Jurok404 said, “Human evolution would probably
just be: -don't need sleep -don't need food

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:20.970
-can be quick -can learn faster -cannot kill
scp-682 because nothing can”

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:24.520
Hey now, have a bit more faith in the fully
mechanized future!

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:28.490
If we can beat sleep then we can take on that
overgrown lizard.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:29.490
Maybe.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:34.080
Midna Arashi said, “I'd probably go with
a full body prosthesis like in the anime Ghost

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.700
in the Shell with several notable changes.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:40.730
The arms will be transforming rifles with
the option to deploy blades either mantis

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:44.460
style ( i.e. cyberpunk ) or bayonets style.

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:48.020
As for the legs, they would extend into a
form that's similar to the hind legs like

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:50.470
that of a canine or similar animal.

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:55.380
I'd also have a cloaking and enhanced hearing
and eyesight allowing me to see objects outside

00:06:55.380 --> 00:07:00.630
of the visible spectrum and listen in on conversions
that are taking place in the next room.

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:05.440
With this setup, I'd say I'll be something
like a soldier or a spy as I'd imagine the

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:10.160
up keep on a body such as this would be high
and military grade.

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:14.090
Just imagine someone with mantis blades and
extended legs jumping at you from the shadows

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:16.540
out of nowhere screeching in your face.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:20.320
I'd say that any normal people would have
to clean themselves after witnessing such

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:21.610
a sight.”

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:26.270
We’ve talked about a lot of terrifying things
on this channel, but the idea of walking down

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:31.100
the street after a lovely night out at the
robot pub and suddenly seeing a figure leap

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:36.150
out of the shadows, letting out an unholy
screech as it brandishes its mantis blades

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:41.570
and skitters toward you on long, insectoid
legs…That’s going to give us nightmares

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:43.650
for a long time.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:47.639
Congratulations on coming up with the scariest
upgrade in the comments section.

00:07:47.639 --> 00:07:53.520
Your prize is the sheer unadulterated terror
of all unlucky enough to cross your path.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:08:00.040
Jacob Rathbone said, “Definitely a robotic
arm that can split into 2 functional arms

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.919
akin to General Grievous.

00:08:01.919 --> 00:08:06.169
And ears with a voice box that can allow me
to speak and understand all languages, but

00:08:06.169 --> 00:08:10.100
the problem that could arise is that my voice
box could glitch and get stuck in a language

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:11.810
or accent for a time.

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:15.540
I think having one of my eyes replaced with
an artificial eye that can read all known

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.860
languages would be helpful too.”

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:23.410
Wait wait wait, you’re going to put a voice
box in your ears?

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:29.870
Assuming you mean ears and a voice box that
are separate, this is a pretty useful upgrade!

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:33.599
You could travel anywhere you want without
needing to bring a language dictionary or

00:08:33.599 --> 00:08:35.029
a translator.

00:08:35.029 --> 00:08:39.410
As long as you hit up the cyber pharmacy for
your regular dose of antiviral software, you

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:43.169
shouldn’t have to worry about getting stuck
on any one language.

00:08:43.169 --> 00:08:46.970
Make sure you let people know about your artificial
eye though, so they don’t think you’re

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:50.100
flirting with a wink when you’re just trying
to read a street sign.

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:56.819
Shy-Griff said, “Quite simply, I would infect
myself with SCP-217, and then do what an infected

00:08:56.819 --> 00:08:58.930
D-Class did and use SCP-212.

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:04.410
I have no idea what the resulting upgrade
will be, but I will put any of my improvements

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:05.490
to good use.

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:10.769
Edit: I would run myself through Scp-914 on
the “Fine” Setting to work out any kinks.”

00:09:10.769 --> 00:09:16.319
It takes a lot of ambition to attempt to DIY
your own upgrade, and there’s definitely

00:09:16.319 --> 00:09:18.850
a place for that in this new world.

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:22.779
We love the energy, but before you wind up
hurting yourself with unpredictable anomalies

00:09:22.779 --> 00:09:27.480
that might wind up turning you into something
unrecognizable maybe you should put the YouTube

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:33.509
tutorial down, save yourself the agony, and
head to a certified professional instead.

00:09:33.509 --> 00:09:37.779
Tyler Tracy said, “What I thought of was
some kind of energy upgrade.

00:09:37.779 --> 00:09:41.740
In our fast world, allowing people's minds
and hearts to run perfectly without sleep

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:45.420
would enhance everyone's lives, completely
without side effects.

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:50.069
Sure, there is an occasional report or two,
saying this and that about sleepwalking, or

00:09:50.069 --> 00:09:54.740
coming miles from where they had hit the hay,
with no memory of how it happened, but as

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:58.199
for me, friends, I've never been better since
my upgrade.

00:09:58.199 --> 00:10:01.050
Get your upgrade, and be your best self!”

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:03.869
Hmm, this seems completely legit to me!

00:10:03.869 --> 00:10:07.679
No follow-up questions needed, especially
not about the sleepwalking or waking up in

00:10:07.679 --> 00:10:08.679
strange places.

00:10:08.679 --> 00:10:10.839
That’s all probably completely fine.

00:10:10.839 --> 00:10:15.089
You heard Tyler, get your upgrade today and
be your best self!

00:10:15.089 --> 00:10:18.249
Just hope you don’t walk over the edge of
a cliff while you’re getting your eight

00:10:18.249 --> 00:10:19.309
hours in.

00:10:19.309 --> 00:10:26.730
Chungo McChungus said, “I would have additional
mechanical arms attached to myself so that

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:30.949
I can pet so many more mechanical animals,
like furbies.

00:10:30.949 --> 00:10:34.600
They are heralds of our gear gifting God,
I am sure of it.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:38.329
Maybe have an antenna on my head that causes
screens to produce slight amounts of static

00:10:38.329 --> 00:10:40.139
on the picture.

00:10:40.139 --> 00:10:41.139
Just for fun.”

00:10:41.139 --> 00:10:47.660
So just to clarify, your plans for upgrading
your limited human form in the new age of

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:53.999
machines is: getting more arms so you can
pet the wild furbies that will roam the streets,

00:10:53.999 --> 00:10:55.990
and a pranking antenna?

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:58.660
Sounds like you’ve got a great handle on
your priorities.

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:02.220
Chungo McChungus knows what living the good
life is all about!

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:06.910
Seth Cushman said, “Probably would include
solar panels/some way to plug into a power

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:11.810
source, so you can recharge energy while sleeping
or something instead of eating.

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:14.959
Also maybe some sort of light/flashlight thing.

00:11:14.959 --> 00:11:20.029
And maybe a machine that converts CO2 back
into O2. also this is more flesh-based so

00:11:20.029 --> 00:11:24.800
might not apply, but maybe surgically move
my brain into my chest or something somehow,

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:30.010
so then all my vital organs are in one spot,
and I have just one major weak point (chest)

00:11:30.010 --> 00:11:35.450
instead of two (chest and neck/head)”
Where to begin with this one?

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:40.069
The renewable energy and air purification
are all well and good, but what happens to

00:11:40.069 --> 00:11:43.620
your neck once you move your brain into your
chest?

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:45.200
What happens to your head?

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:49.690
Will you put your face on your chest or keep
your face and head where they are, just with

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:53.209
an empty skull and the breeze blowing in one
ear and out the other?

00:11:53.209 --> 00:11:58.050
Won’t your neck still be a weak point because
your throat and esophagus are there and the

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:00.019
airway could still be blocked or damaged?

00:12:00.019 --> 00:12:03.050
I have to move on to the next response before
I get a headache.

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:07.220
Or, as you would say, a chest ache.

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:09.769
Nightigal said, “Built in respirator.

00:12:09.769 --> 00:12:14.720
Unless part of this clockwork take over involves
switching to 100% clean energy, and seeing

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:18.980
as you specifically name dropped the sect
that has the whole steampunk thing going on,

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:23.649
a respirator will be necessary to avoid dying
of some lung disease from the increase of

00:12:23.649 --> 00:12:25.410
pollutants in the air.”

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:28.989
A very thoughtful, and kind of depressing,
answer.

00:12:28.989 --> 00:12:30.230
Why stop there?

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:33.860
Scrap the lungs altogether and eliminate the
need for breathing at all, then it doesn’t

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:35.980
matter how rancid the air gets.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:39.800
Better get rid of your sense of smell, too,
if we’re being honest.

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:44.950
Young Love said, “Literal finger gun upgrades,
replace my arms up to my elbows, and where

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:49.610
I reload would be by putting bullets In the
base of my wrist, like putting coins in an

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:55.360
arcade machine, with inner workings functioning
similar to a 9 round mag for a .308 hunting

00:12:55.360 --> 00:13:00.009
rifle, firing with twice as much force when
shot because my replaced limbs would cycle

00:13:00.009 --> 00:13:05.589
back all of the carbon and other gasses back
into the chamber to make it not only louder,

00:13:05.589 --> 00:13:10.309
but deadlier with a higher velocity to hit
targets from farther away.”

00:13:10.309 --> 00:13:11.649
Finger guns!

00:13:11.649 --> 00:13:13.769
Actual finger guns!

00:13:13.769 --> 00:13:17.860
Everyone you meet will be on edge, they’ll
never know if you’re just being a cool friendly

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:19.670
dude, or if you’re about to blow their head
off.

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:22.450
They won’t be able to tell until it’s
too late.

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:24.740
No notes, this is just plain awesome.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:29.639
Cheesyminer said, “I would wish to become
completely mechanical solely for the purpose

00:13:29.639 --> 00:13:33.670
of calling anyone that still has exposed skin
"meatbags".”

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:38.930
That’s a perfectly valid reason, and we
here at SCP Explained condone any and all

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:42.350
meatbag bullying once Mekhane has become the
ruler of all.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:44.769
Laugh at them and their failing organic bodies.

00:13:44.769 --> 00:13:46.110
Oh, you’ve got flesh still?

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:47.639
Can’t afford metal skin?

00:13:47.639 --> 00:13:50.509
Did your mom give you those internal organs?

00:13:50.509 --> 00:13:51.509
Loser.

00:13:51.509 --> 00:13:55.990
Francisco Souza said, “I would have a special
compartment in my wrist that stores all the

00:13:55.990 --> 00:14:00.589
methane in my body and then releases the pressurized
gas and sets it ablaze.

00:14:00.589 --> 00:14:03.110
It's stupid, and that's why it's perfect.”

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:04.519
This is incredible.

00:14:04.519 --> 00:14:08.519
You have the chance to change anything about
yourself, and you went with weaponized farts.

00:14:08.519 --> 00:14:12.959
You’re right, it’s perfect, and it’s
a great way to embarrass your enemies mid-combat

00:14:12.959 --> 00:14:14.019
while dealing a ton of damage.

00:14:14.019 --> 00:14:15.019
“Hey honey, how was the battle today?”

00:14:15.019 --> 00:14:16.019
“I don’t want to talk about it.”

00:14:16.019 --> 00:14:18.369
“Oh dear, what’s that smell?”

00:14:18.369 --> 00:14:22.629
“I SAID, I don’t want to TALK ABOUT IT!”

00:14:22.629 --> 00:14:28.589
The shy puppet said, “A chain saw for a
hand so that I can "dispose" my enemies more

00:14:28.589 --> 00:14:32.610
easily”
And, after a long day of horrific carnage

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:37.769
when you just want to curl up on the couch
and relax, you can chop firewood in a snap!

00:14:37.769 --> 00:14:42.619
DwemerSmith said, ”Eliminating individualities
in the brain would cause everybody to think

00:14:42.619 --> 00:14:45.519
alike, and no one would disagree or be disloyal.”

00:14:45.519 --> 00:14:50.720
Well, this is one commenter who should never
be in charge of a post-apocalyptic society.

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:51.720
Noted.

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:55.320
Just gonna slowly back away from this one…

00:14:55.320 --> 00:15:00.739
Atris Hayport said, “I would simply have
my mind uploaded to a computer, once it's

00:15:00.739 --> 00:15:01.739
data...

00:15:01.739 --> 00:15:04.129
It can go anywhere, and can be put into anything...

00:15:04.129 --> 00:15:08.069
My concern is that once I am no longer in
a human body I would lose all emotion and

00:15:08.069 --> 00:15:09.920
drive to do anything...

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:13.420
Because usually thats governed by our complex
meat sacs...

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:17.720
But if I had some sort of sliders I could
adjust everything about myself I think that

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:18.720
would be enough...

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:23.509
But the actual goal is to experience everything
and when there is no more universe, when I'm

00:15:23.509 --> 00:15:28.250
in space watching everything implode give
out one remaining chuckle as I put myself

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:33.509
in an infinite dream only to wake if the universe
reignites so I can watch it”

00:15:33.509 --> 00:15:39.650
This is a pretty grand idea, but one quick
question: If there is no more universe, what

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:42.189
would happen to the computer you’re stored
on?

00:15:42.189 --> 00:15:44.949
It would be a part of the universe, correct?

00:15:44.949 --> 00:15:49.540
Not trying to rain on your immortality parade,
but the mechanics of this one (pun intended)

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:51.519
are a bit confusing.

00:15:51.519 --> 00:15:55.889
You’ll figure something out though, once
you’ve got that superpowered data brain.

00:15:55.889 --> 00:15:56.889
Probably.

00:15:56.889 --> 00:16:01.259
Prophet of the 8th Legion said, “From the
moment I understood the weakness of my flesh,

00:16:01.259 --> 00:16:02.459
it disgusted me.

00:16:02.459 --> 00:16:05.069
I craved the strength and certainty of steel.

00:16:05.069 --> 00:16:08.269
I aspired to the purity of the blessed machine.

00:16:08.269 --> 00:16:14.809
Your kind cling to your flesh as if it will
not decay and fail you.~Litany of the Omnissiahs

00:16:14.809 --> 00:16:18.310
chosen”
Hey everybody, the life of the party is here!

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:20.459
Thanks for that, Prophet of the 8th Legion.

00:16:20.459 --> 00:16:24.689
It was quick, to the point, and just terrifying
enough to set the tone for the rest of the

00:16:24.689 --> 00:16:25.689
day.

00:16:25.689 --> 00:16:28.040
Death to the old flesh, long live the machines!

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:29.299
Am I right?

00:16:29.299 --> 00:16:33.859
Now go check out “SCP-096 - Look at a Picture
of Shy Guy in Space?

00:16:33.859 --> 00:16:39.670
The Shy Guy Questions and Theories” and
“SCP-049 - What Actually is the Pestilence?

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:44.869
The Plague Doctor Questions and Theories”
for more questions and answers from the SCP

00:16:44.869 --> 00:16:45.859
Explained community

